Description: |
  Write/ingestion-path fan-in boundary. Sourced by direct reading of main.go's `Init`,
  `Stop`, and `RequestHandler`, and by grepping its route table against the ~16 sibling
  subpackages directly under app/vminsert/. Confirmed (via grep of app/vminsert/common and
  app/vminsert/main.go) that lib/storage is reached only indirectly through the `common`
  subpackage and the storage-facing cell's `VMInsertAPI`, never imported by main.go itself.
